OL,3,GNEWSAMore volunteers wanted to help
OL,4,AGuide Dogs charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guide Dogs charity has urged anyone
OL,7,Finterested in becoming a volunteer to
OL,8,Fraise a puppy to get in touch as it
OL,9,Flooks to recruit more.
OL,11,FIt currently has 17 guide dog puppies
OL,12,Fbeing raised in Berkshire but wants to
OL,13,Frecruit another 25 homes to help with
OL,14,Fits work.
OL,16,FVolunteers look after the puppies for
OL,17,Fthe first year to 14 months of their
OL,18,Flives before they are taken on further,
OL,19,Fmore advanced training.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
